# Project Guidelines

This is a personal website project. Follow these guidelines when working on this codebase:

## Code Style
- Use modern, clean code practices
- Prefer functional programming where appropriate
- Write maintainable and readable code
- use React.ts

## File Organization
- Keep related files together
- Use clear, descriptive file and folder names
- Follow conventional project structure patterns

## Best Practices
- Ensure responsive design for all components
- Optimize for performance
- Maintain accessibility standards
- Write self-documenting code, without comments
- make all constants, text, names and data stored as variables in specific relevant files.

